reviews.content:
It has 1 dish only: stir fried beef in pho noodle soup. And it is the best at it.
Some remarks:
1. Order the QUAY side dish, best dipped in the pho soup;
2. Can order a raw yolk, eat it as a whole with a spoon of pho soup;
3. Put some chilly sauce, vinegar, pepper to add to the flavor.
3. Need some patience, might wait 10 minutes for your pho to arrive;
4. Do not mind the loud old men (owner) from outside, he means no harm :)
That's it, enjoy :)
Cheers,
Tuan
